<section class="relative min-h-[50vh] flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-[#030a16]"><div class="absolute inset-0 z-0"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782368005/eurocert/c8.png.png" class="w-full h-full object-cover opacity-25" alt="LVD/EMC"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#030a16]/80 via-transparent to-[#030a16]"></div></div><div class="container mx-auto px-6 relative z-10 text-center py-24"><h4 data-reveal="reveal-up" class="heading-font text-[11px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-6 font-bold">Low Voltage &amp; EMC Directive</h4><h1 data-reveal="reveal-up" data-reveal-delay="150" class="heading-font text-5xl sm:text-7xl md:text-8xl font-bold text-white mb-4 tracking-tight" style="text-shadow:0 0 20px rgba(212,168,67,0.4)">CE Marking</h1><h3 data-reveal="reveal-up" data-reveal-delay="250" class="heading-font text-white/80 text-base md:text-xl uppercase tracking-[0.3em] mb-4">LVD/EMC</h3><div data-reveal="reveal-scale" data-reveal-delay="350" class="w-24 h-0.5 bg-eurogold-400 mx-auto mb-6 shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(212,168,67,0.6)]"></div><p data-reveal="reveal-up" data-reveal-delay="450" class="text-white/90 text-sm md:text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">Low Voltage Directive and Electromagnetic Compatibility certification for electrical equipment.</p></div></section><section class="py-16 lg:py-20 bg-white"><div class="container mx-auto px-6 grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center"><div class="space-y-8"><div data-reveal="reveal-left"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-3 font-bold">Standard Overview</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">CE Marking for<br/><span class="text-euro-600">LVD/EMC</span></h2></div><p data-reveal="reveal-left" data-reveal-delay="150" class="text-slate-500 text-lg leading-relaxed">We provide comprehensive Low Voltage Directive and Electromagnetic Compatibility certification and compliance services.</p><div data-reveal="reveal-left" data-reveal-delay="250" class="p-8 rounded-3xl border border-euro-200 bg-euro-50/50"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">What is LVD/EMC?</h4><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">The Low Voltage Directive (LVD 2014/35/EU) and Electromagnetic Compatibility Directive (EMC 2014/30/EU) are essential for electrical and electronic equipment sold in the EU. LVD covers safety of electrical equipment operating between 50-1000V AC and 75-1500V DC, while EMC ensures equipment doesn&#x27;t generate or is affected by electromagnetic interference.</p></div></div><div data-reveal="reveal-right" data-reveal-delay="200" class="relative rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-[0_32px_80px_-15px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)] border border-slate-100 h-[350px] sm:h-[450px] md:h-[550px] group"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/didtfhfme/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1783924539/lvd_bw9jnr.png" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-1000 group-hover:scale-110" alt="LVD/EMC Certification"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-900/30 via-transparent to-transparent"></div></div></div></section><section class="py-16 lg:py-20 bg-[#f8fafc]"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 data-reveal="reveal-up" class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-3 font-bold">Comprehensive Services</h4><h2 data-reveal="reveal-up" data-reveal-delay="150" class="heading-font text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Service Nodes</h2></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8"><div data-reveal="reveal-up" data-reveal-delay="0" class="text-center p-10 bg-white rounded-3xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-[0_20px_60px_-15px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)] transition-all